# This repo is code-only. All pipeline outputs — normalized personas, run
# directories, generated sessions, gold, benchmark items, reports, raw model
# outputs — are regenerated from source via the Makefile. The full corpus and
# gold splits live in the private HuggingFace dataset (see data/samples/README.md).
data/generated/
data/personas/normalized/
data/raw_model_outputs/
data/runs/

# Generated life-event subgraph visualizations (regenerate via
